OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh government and Labour strike
OL,4,Adeal on mini-budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government has reached a deal
OL,7,Fwith Labour on its mini-budget, which
OL,8,Fhad failed to pass in the summer.
OL,10,FMinisters said the Plaid Cymru-led
OL,11,Fadministration had now agreed an extra
OL,12,F#60m for children with additional
OL,13,Flearning needs (ALN).
OL,15,FLabour, who sit in opposition after
OL,16,Flosing May's Senedd election, had
OL,17,Frejected a #40m a year deal across
OL,18,Fthree years, in acrimonious scenes at
OL,19,Fthe Welsh Parliament in the last week
OL,20,Fof term in July.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
